      "composition_id": "NEW-U05-TEXT-A",
      "title": "Food for the companions and the birds",
      "origin": "new_teaching_material",
      "status": "reconciled_pre_contract_design",
      "intended_meaning": "Two men carried food. Their companions sat in the dwelling. The men gave the companions the food, and they ate. One man did not eat. He gave his food to the birds. The birds ate and flew. The man sat on the shore and saw the fish. The fish swam in the water.",
