      "scope": "All nouns and constructions are prior or explicitly new productive. No source-only quantifier, temporal adverb, goal phrase, relative/content clause or nonfinite construction. The bird recipients/food use are declared ordinary lexical applications, not claims of verbatim source quotation.",
